        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Johannes Vermeer\n- Works: The Music Lesson, Young Woman Seated at a Virginal\n- Places: Louvre Museum, Paris\n- Concepts: Dutch painting, domestic interior scenes, middle-class life\n\nFacts:\n- Johannes Vermeer was a Dutch painter who specialized in domestic interior scenes of middle-class life.\n- Johannes Vermeer painted a work known as The Music Lesson.\n- Johannes Vermeer also painted Young Woman Seated at a Virginal, which depicts a young woman dressed in a yellow shawl.\n- Young Woman Seated at a Virginal is in the Louvre Museum in Paris.",
